 "remarks": "Amazing 1 level 3 bedroom home with additional office space lives like a single family. Entertaining is a pleasure in this open layout with the chef sized kitchen boasting double wall ovens, oversized island with seating, dining area and adjacent great room with bar and fireplace. French doors open to the expansive patio and private fenced yard. A large formal dining room can double as another sitting room. Primary bedroom with full bath has a large walk in closet and opens to a private terrace.  Two generous family bedrooms share a newly renovated (2019) hall bath with walk in shower.  You can work from home in the attached office just off the mud room.  This is a unique home that feels more like a single family than a mulit-family: the two attached one bedroom apartments have their own entrance and their own outdoor space. Level fenced yard is all yours, not shared.  Minimum credit score of 700 required. New washer/dryer, stove top and double ovens 2026.",
